<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>ALLSONSIV LLC</title>

    <!-- Styles & Background -->
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: url('image5.jpg') no-repeat center center fixed;
            background-size: cover;
        }

        h1 {
            color: darkblue;
            font-size: 48px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            text-align: center;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }

        .about-homes {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            padding: 80px 20px;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
        }

        .home-block {
            width: 30%;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            margin: 10px;
        }

        .home-block h2 {
            color: darkblue;
            font-size: 26px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .home-block p {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #333;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Main Heading -->
    <h1>ALLSONSIV LLC</h1>
    <p>Family-owned and operated, providing custom homes, windows, and doors throughout the greater Nashville area.</p>

    <!-- About Our Homes Section -->
    <section class="about-homes">
        <div class="home-block">
            <h2>Custom Homes</h2>
            <p>Design and build your dream home with quality, attention to detail, and lasting comfort.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="home-block">
            <h2>Windows</h2>
            <p>Energy-efficient, stylish, and durable windows for every home we build.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="home-block">
            <h2>Doors</h2>
            <p>Secure and beautiful doors crafted to enhance both the safety and look of your home.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

</body>
</html>
